{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/16432-promethean-storytelling-gone-wrong","id":16432,"title":"Promethean Storytelling Gone Wrong?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-22T19:46:10-08:00","id":16432,"title":"Promethean Storytelling Gone Wrong?","content":"I got my hands on the Promethean books, read them, loved them, and decided to run a game with them. I am an experienced storyteller of both old and new WoD but I decided to run &quot;The Water of Life&quot; to get a feel for how the players would react. It... didnt go very well. The PCs dont trust the Alchemist at all and see no reason to make the Aqua Vitae and take a short cut along the pilgrimage. They are all playing newly created prometheans.<br /> <br /> Any one have any suggestions on how to move ahead with this story without railroading the players?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If people were meant to run around naked, they would be born that way.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1286-nikuchan","name":"Nikuchan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1286_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-23T00:49:11-08:00","id":16511,"title":"","content":"So the players have rejected the obvious hook. I recommend trying something entirely different, then .. there are always options for returning to the Calogero plot later, but as of now, I think they've made it clear that they're not interested. It is rarely a good idea to force plot on the player.<br /> <br /> For alternate suggestions, I recommend skimming through my 1001 Plot Hook thread. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/286-christian-a","name":"Christian A","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"832"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-23T02:09:02-08:00","id":16528,"title":"","content":"I don't know the storyline, but maybe tweak things a bit: like, maybe the Aqua Vitae requires to sacrifice 5 Prometheans, and Prometheans start disappearing, draw them in that way. This'd play well if they distrust the NPC in question.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mSW2-p-SwmYw5gaqnVMQ7HcRNhVedC-aA4vB6sBclGk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for GMs</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hslzrmui6ML-v7LniQUXLNyy8o52YF9g2u6usdu-Drc/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for Players</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/207-allan53","name":"Allan53","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"966"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T10:00:51-08:00","id":17775,"title":"","content":"Do they have any strong idea of what they <i>do</i> want to do? Any details, even that seemed minor at the time, that they enjoyed? Follow up with something they like, let them make their Pilgrimage the way they want. Later on, if they meet a Promethean that swears by the Aqua Vitae, maybe they'll reconsider it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}